---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Lead Your Team | George Rios" description="Fractional tech lead and architect. I join your standups, review PRs, unblock your devs, and make the technical calls.">
  <nav
    x-data="{ scrolled: false, mobileOpen: false }"
    x-init="window.addEventListener('scroll', () => { scrolled = window.scrollY > 20 })"
    :class="{ 'bg-[#0a0a0a]/95 backdrop-blur-sm border-b border-[#27272a]': scrolled }"
    class="fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 transition-all duration-300"
  >
    <div class="max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between">
      <a href="/" class="font-mono text-[#e4e4e7] font-semibold tracking-tight">
        <span class="text-[#22c55e]">~</span>$ plsft/george
      </a>

      <div class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-8">
        <a href="/#services" class="nav-link">Services</a>
        <a href="/#stack" class="nav-link">Stack</a>
        <a href="/#about" class="nav-link">About</a>
        <a href="https://cal.com/plurral/30m" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary text-xs py-2 px-4">Book a Call</a>
      </div>

      <button @click="mobileOpen = !mobileOpen" class="md:hidden text-[#e4e4e7] hover:text-[#22c55e] transition-colors">
        <svg x-show="!mobileOpen" class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16" />
        </svg>
        <svg x-show="mobileOpen" x-cloak class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12" />
        </svg>
      </button>
    </div>

    <div x-show="mobileOpen" x-cloak class="md:hidden bg-[#0a0a0a] border-t border-[#27272a]">
      <div class="px-6 py-4 flex flex-col gap-4">
        <a href="/#services" @click="mobileOpen = false" class="nav-link">Services</a>
        <a href="/#stack" @click="mobileOpen = false" class="nav-link">Stack</a>
        <a href="/#about" @click="mobileOpen = false" class="nav-link">About</a>
        <a href="https://cal.com/plurral/30m" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary text-center">Book a Call</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="scanlines pt-24">
    <section class="py-16 px-6">
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <div class="terminal-window">
          <div class="terminal-titlebar">
            <div class="terminal-dot terminal-dot-red"></div>
            <div class="terminal-dot terminal-dot-yellow"></div>
            <div class="terminal-dot terminal-dot-green"></div>
            <span class="ml-4 text-[#71717a] text-xs font-mono">lead_team.md</span>
          </div>
          <div class="terminal-content space-y-8">
            <div>
              <span class="text-[#22c55e] font-mono text-sm">// service</span>
              <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#e4e4e7] mt-4">
                <span class="text-[#22c55e]">></span> lead_team
              </h1>
            </div>

            <div class="border-t border-[#27272a] pt-8 space-y-6">
              <p class="text-xl text-[#e4e4e7] leading-relaxed">
                Your developers are good, but they're stuck. Stuck on architecture decisions, blocked by technical debt, or just unsure which direction to take. A good tech lead removes those blockers — that's what I do.
              </p>
              <p class="text-lg text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">
                As a fractional tech lead, I integrate with your team. I join standups, review PRs, unblock developers, and make the technical calls that have been languishing in your backlog. I help your team speak the same language and ship with confidence.
              </p>
              <p class="text-lg text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">
                No micromanaging. No endless meetings. Just clear technical direction and someone willing to dive into the code when needed.
              </p>

              <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 pt-4">
                <div class="terminal-window">
                  <div class="terminal-titlebar">
                    <div class="terminal-dot terminal-dot-red"></div>
                    <div class="terminal-dot terminal-dot-yellow"></div>
                    <div class="terminal-dot terminal-dot-green"></div>
                    <span class="ml-4 text-[#71717a] text-xs font-mono">what_you_get.sh</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="terminal-content">
                    <ul class="space-y-3 text-[#71717a]">
                      <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-[#22c55e]">✓</span><span>Direct access to 25 years of enterprise architecture experience</span></li>
                      <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-[#22c55e]">✓</span><span>Ship faster with proven frameworks (Levi, Tanstack)</span></li>
                      <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-[#22c55e]">✓</span><span>Cloudflare-native architecture from day one</span></li>
                      <li class="flex items-start gap-3"><span class="text-[#22c55e]">✓</span><span>No more deferred technical decisions</span></li>
                    </ul>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="terminal-window">
                  <div class="terminal-titlebar">
                    <div class="terminal-dot terminal-dot-red"></div>
                    <div class="terminal-dot terminal-dot-yellow"></div>
                    <div class="terminal-dot terminal-dot-green"></div>
                    <span class="ml-4 text-[#71717a] text-xs font-mono">stack.md</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="terminal-content">
                    <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
                      <span class="tech-badge">PR Reviews</span>
                      <span class="tech-badge">Architecture</span>
                      <span class="tech-badge">Team Leading</span>
                      <span class="tech-badge">TypeScript</span>
                      <span class="tech-badge">dotnet</span>
                      <span class="tech-badge">C#</span>
                      <span class="tech-badge">Code Quality</span>
                    </div>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="border-t border-[#27272a] pt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
                <a href="https://cal.com/plurral/30m" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn-primary text-center">[ Book a Call ]</a>
                <a href="/" class="btn-primary bg-transparent border border-[#27272a] hover:border-[#22c55e] hover:bg-transparent text-center">[ ← Back to Home ]</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <style is:global>[x-cloak] { display: none !important; }</style>
</Layout>
